# Markdown is not formatted, deliberately.
#
# The gate this repo enforces is `eslint .` with prettier/prettier, and
# eslint does not lint markdown, so formatting it buys nothing. It costs
# something: the first run re-indented a YAML fragment in
# packages/action/README.md that is deliberately indented to show where it
# slots into an existing workflow, and re-padded the columns of the
# `satus-version` table that scripts/validate-docs.mjs parses to check
# version drift — which turned a passing gate into "(unparsed)".
#
# src/content/blog is the same argument with more at stake: 43 published
# posts, some embargoed, all rendered by `marked`. Prose is edited
# deliberately, not by a formatter.
*.md
